  "body": "Positioned in one of St Heliers' most sought after locations, this elevated cedar and weatherboard residence offers a wonderful combination of sea views, all day sun and effortless lock-up and leave living. Designed for modern lifestyles and long term comfort, the four bedroom, three and a half bathroom home has the convenience of a lift providing easy access throughout.\r\n\r\nRecently beautifully landscaped, the property offers great off-street parking and planted grounds in addition to a double-garage. Just a short stroll from St Heliers Beach, village, cafes, restaurants, parks and sought after schools, this is a rare opportunity to secure a low maintenance coastal home at an affordable price point in a blue chip location.\r\n\r\nLight-filled open plan living and dining areas flow seamlessly to a generous deck capturing views across the Waitemata Harbour. A designer kitchen forms the heart of the home, while the flexible floorplan caters equally well to families, downsizers or those seeking space for guests.\r\n\r\nThe main suite enjoys its own balcony, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, accompanied by two further bedrooms and a separate office. On the lower level, a self-contained studio with kitchenette and ensuite offers endless possibilities, whether for extended family, guests, Airbnb income, a media room or games room.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include internal access double garaging, extra off-street parking, separate laundry facilities and a fully fenced, landscaped freehold site.\r\n\r\nVendors are on the move and ready to sell. Don't miss this outstanding St Heliers opportunity.",
